cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
title: "SecLLM-Dataset: A Static-Analysis-Based Dataset for Vulnerability Detection, Explanation, and Repair with LLMs"
authors:
  - name: "Sparrow Co., Ltd."
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sparrow-Co-Ltd/SecLLM-Dataset"
url: "https://github.com/Sparrow-Co-Ltd/SecLLM-Dataset"
abstract: >-
  A JSON Lines dataset of security vulnerabilities found by static analysis (SAST)
  in real open-source Java code. Each record includes the full source file, the
  reported line, bilingual (Korean/English) type descriptions and examples, the
  analyzer's data-flow trace, and a patch whose fix was confirmed by re-running SAST.
keywords:
  - dataset
  - security
  - vulnerability detection
  - static analysis
  - SAST
  - program repair
  - large language models
  - Java
